OL,4,CBurnham and Badenoch clash at PMQs     
OL,5,Cover university fees for EU students   
OL,6,Cin UK                                  
OL,7,GAndy Burnham and Kemi Badenoch clash   
OL,8,Gover the government's new EU deal at   
OL,9,GPMQs.                                  
OL,11,FBadenoch asks whether the deal - on    
OL,12,Fyouth mobility, food exports and       
OL,13,Femissions trading - is contingent on   
OL,14,Ftalks about lowering tuition fees paid 
OL,15,Fby EU students in the UK.              
OL,17,FBurnham says the tuition fee agreement 
OL,18,F"is not done" - citing the president   
OL,19,Fof the European Commission as saying   
OL,20,F"it's on a separate piece of paper" to 
OL,21,Fthe one agreed on Friday.              
